0,Mandinka people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandinka_people,"2 weeks ago - The Mandinka are the descendants of the Mali Empire, which rose to power in the 13th century under the rule of king Sundiata Keita, who founded an empire that would go on to span a large part of West Africa. They migrated west from the Niger River in search of better agricultural lands and ...",Mandinka,Niger-Congo
