5,The Indigenous Mandinka People - Peoples of the World,https://peoplesoftheworld.org/text?people=Mandinka,"This art form is passed down in Mandinka tradition through the male lineage. Musical performance in Mandinka society is not restricted to males. Indeed another hallmark of the onset of culture, in general, is the pervasion of ceremonial music.",Mandinka,Niger-Congo
6,Mande Music Eric Charry | PDF - Scribd,https://www.scribd.com/document/991018753/Mande-Music-Eric-Charry,"The document is a comprehensive exploration of the traditional and modern music of the Maninka and Mandinka peoples of Western Africa, authored by Eric Charry. It covers various aspects including historical context, musical instruments, performance practices, and the evolution of music in the region.",Mandinka,Niger-Congo
