9,Discover Mandinka – KOLI & OLUM,https://koliolum.com/pages/mandinka,"The Kora: The kora, a symbol of Mandinka musical tradition, is a stunning 21-string instrument crafted from half a calabash, elegantly covered with cowhide and adorned with decorative tacks. Its unique sound holes double as coin holders, where tokens of appreciation are stored for the mesmerizing performances of Mandinka praise singers.",Mandinka,Niger-Congo
